  "description": "The Cuemon.Security.Cryptography namespace contains types related to cryptographic hashing (both keyed and non-keyed) and a ready-to-use implementation of the Advanced Encryption Standard (AES) symmetric algorithm. The namespace is an addition to the System.Security.Cryptography namespace.",
